6a2713158959a0c4eed0898d1022f0e29d00fef95e6a8492bde3bd884407270fc8905fdbc2d7e252cba3224c6f81727d393da1bdd53b4a9298213b86c240fb56  enjoys-os.script
5c882e25fafef8114c30c509cb28c96b947bec40f67cc32a8bd473251295a296108436fa37e87138ff6a8683fe639dff68b3268956980b9448e3012a910e1314  logo.png
"
